#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilemaps.rst:191
msgid ""
"Using the toolbar at the top of the TileMap editor, you can choose between "
"several painting modes and tools. These modes affect operation when clicking "
"in the 2D editor, **not** the TileMap panel itself."
msgstr ""
"Usando a barra de ferramentas na parte superior do editor de TileMap, pode "
"escolher entre diversos modos e ferramentas de pintura. Estes modos afetam "
"as operações ao clicar no editor 2D, **não** no próprio painel do TileMap."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/using_tilemaps.rst:195
msgid "From left to right, the painting modes and tools you can choose are:"
msgstr ""
